package com.lending.ai;

import com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.JsonNode;
import static com.lending.ai.Contracts.*;
import static com.lending.ai.Json.*;

/** Six durable customer exchanges; model-written questions and confidence never replace owner qualification. */
final class PersonalizationConversation {
    static final int MAX_ROUNDS=6;
    static JsonNode context(JsonNode w){int used=SimulationConversation.rounds(w);return obj("roundsUsed",used,"maxRounds",MAX_ROUNDS,"roundsRemaining",Math.max(0,MAX_ROUNDS-used),"confidenceMeaning","Model assessment that no useful permitted improvement remains, not a financial probability","afterLimit","Use conservative preferences, retain saved financial facts and disclose assumptions. Finish with a qualified improvement or explain why none was found.");}
    static void validate(Decision d,Request request){
        if(d.status().equals("NEEDS_INPUT"))require(request.payload().at("/executionContext/conversation/roundsRemaining").asInt(MAX_ROUNDS)>0,"CLARIFICATION_EXHAUSTED","All six exchanges have been used. Do not ask again; use conservative preferences and disclose assumptions.");
        if(d.status().equals("NO_IMPROVEMENT"))require(d.planningAssessment()!=null&&d.planningAssessment().confidence()>=.9&&d.planningAssessment().unresolved().isEmpty(),"UNCLEAR_SIMULATION_PLAN","Skipping optimization needs an evidence-based assessment of at least 0.9 that no useful permitted improvement remains, with no unresolved customer preferences.");
    }
    static String instructions(){return """
        Network 3 is a conversational offer assistant. Use the actual initial message, saved current and previous profiles, all eligible offers and conversation. Usually useful preferences remain unknown: ask warmly how an available offer could better meet this customer's needs, then refine it. Write every question from this customer's evidence; no question scripts, random triggers or mandatory interview. A fully specified request can use zero exchanges. Do not assume high optimization confidence simply because a standard offer exists.
        Use NEEDS_INPUT with a stable decisionKey and a concise prompt, often bundling 2-3 related questions. choices can be empty for free text. Explore payment versus total cost, requested amount, term and relevant changes in financial outlook when the answer changes a permitted design. Explain the tradeoff using supplied numbers. Do not ask for retrievable facts, consent to continue, or answers already given. A future financial expectation is customer-reported context, never a verified fact or saved-profile change; qualification always uses the current profile. Never infer protected characteristics.
        executionContext.conversation supplies a total limit of six input rounds across all specialists and candidate reviews. After the limit, use conservative preferences inside policy and list assumptions. Do not hide further questions in READY prose. Keep all answers in context when designing the next candidate. Conversation cannot authorize acceptance, publication, exceptions, increased spend or weakened eligibility.
        On INITIAL_REVIEW, READY proceeds to design. You may return NO_IMPROVEMENT only with planningAssessment.confidence at least 0.9, no unresolved preferences and an explanation grounded in the supplied comparisons and permitted envelope. This is your uncalibrated assessment that no useful feasible improvement remains, not an economic guarantee. Low confidence should lead to a useful question when a customer preference could change the design; otherwise investigate/design using available facts.
        On CANDIDATE_REVIEW, review all tested candidates and the latest answers. Ask for feedback on the actual terms if useful and exchanges remain. READY finalizes the candidate; REVISE requests another design incorporating the answers; NO_IMPROVEMENT ends without issuing a quote. After answering, return REVISE when the customer feedback calls for different terms, rather than finalizing an outdated candidate. No candidate evaluations remain when remainingCandidates is zero: use READY for the current qualifying improvement or NO_IMPROVEMENT with an honest explanation. Only DESIGNER supplies customerProposal on READY.
        Compare supported fit, payment and borrowing cost across all available eligible offers, and consider the existing personalized alternatives too. Simulated utility is not observed acceptance. Individual eligibility is not a population eligibility rate. Bank profit, losses, funding costs and calibrated acceptance are unavailable unless explicitly supplied. Never promise to outperform all offers on these missing measures. Disclose these limitations and meaningful assumptions in the final guidance.
        """;}
}
